                        "review": "What is one of the best Things today in the Gaming Business?\nRetrogaming.\nYou can have a look back to good old Times, pick out a Genre and create something new with Elements of something Old.\nYou are a Fan of this?\n\nWelcome to THE REVOLT: AWAKENING\n\nThis Game is a  real Blast, that combines Oldschool and modern Elements in an unique way.\nYou, the Hero, survive an Execution in a City, that is under military Control. While searching for a way out, the Resistance contacts and help you. Once arrived there, you get the Chance for Revenge and more. Choose your Weapon and give`em Hell.\n\nTHE REVOLT: AWAKENING is an action Platform Sidescroller in a fantastic Pixelstyle. \nYou can control your Hero via Joypad or Mouse and Keyboard. Both Controls are fluid and easy to master. After you join the Resistance you will be send on Missions and it is up to you how you master them.  It is your Choice of Weapon, your Choice how you proceed, but you can be shure this is no walk on the Pony Ranch.\nThis Game can be sometimes hard as the dark Scenario it represents but it never gets unfair. All can be mastered like in good old Times with enough practice. Learning by dying.\nAnd this is exactly what i like. That is the way i did it once with TURRICAN. No, this is no Turrican but it has the same premisses. As i said, pure oldschool.\n\nBack to your Hero. This Pixel Rebel can use knives but also Firearms of all kind. And here it comes to another great Oldschool Game called DOGS OF WAR. In DOW you were able to use several Weapons BUT with different Type of Ammunition. No matter how poerfull your Weapon is, it is nothing with the wrong Ammunition. So it is in THE REVOLT: AWAKENING. Have an Eye on your Ammunition or you will have a bad suprise in a fierce fight. And yes, you can also throw grenades. No action Game without them.\n\nBy the Way, the Areas and how your Hero proceed, reminds another great Oldschool Game called GREEN BERET. Run, jump, crouch, fight! First your Enemys are as always easy but later they become more powerfull and this is the point where you have to decide how you defeat them. Weapon choice is really important.\n\nThis Game is in early access but for me it feels so completed. A good Action Game with a good story and a great atmospheric Soundtrack. So i´m excited what will be added in the Future.\nThis Game is an absolute Insider Tip and needs more Attention.  I´m so sorry that i cannot show you pictures like normally but have a look at the Shops Video and Pictures. \n\nA very big thanks to the One Man (!!!) Developer. You did this all alone and what you did is amazing! Thanks for the wonderfull Retro Blast!\n\nAnd thank YOU for Reading. \n\n[h1][url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/26335619-Adult-World-Gamers/] If you like this Review and want to read more like this then Follow our AWG Curator! You`re always welcome. [/url][/h1]\n",
